assets/g1_unified -- license and provenance

This directory is NOT covered by the repository's root MIT license. Each file
keeps the terms of its origin:

1. meshes/*.STL
   Unitree G1 robot description meshes, unmodified.
   Source: Unitree Robotics' official G1 description
   (e.g. https://github.com/unitreerobotics/unitree_ros).
   License: BSD 3-Clause License (full text below).

2. robot.xml
   Derived from ScaleBFM (https://github.com/zengweishuai/ScaleBFM),
   ScaleBridge/scalebridge/data/robot/g1_29dof/g1_29dof_dex3.xml.
   Modified: the bundled scene (second asset/worldbody pair, visual and
   statistic elements) was removed; see README.md in this directory.
   The underlying geometry is the Unitree G1 description (BSD 3-Clause).
   License status of the ScaleBFM-specific content: license pending
   confirmation from the author. The upstream repository does not currently
   publish a license.

3. robot_fk.xml
   Derived from motion_tracking (https://github.com/Axellwppr/motion_tracking),
   sim2real/config/g1/assets/g1.xml. Modified: visual mesh geoms removed.
   License: MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Axell.

4. README.md
   Documentation written for g1_backend, Copyright (c) 2026 Gamma Robotics,
   MIT License (see the LICENSE file at the repository root).

